<title>MEXICO: Cemex 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Cemex 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>	Shr		 5.91		     5.82</p>
<p>	Net		 7.699 bln		7.495 bln</p>
